    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O'DWYER ARE HAPPY TO PRESENT TO THE MARKET THIS ATTRACTIVE 3 BEDROOM SEMI DETACHED RESIDENCE IN THE HIGHLY POPULAR DEVELOPMENT OF THE DRUMLINS CLOSE TO VIRGINIA TOWN CENTRE"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.1m x 2.6m\n\n\nSitting Room - 5.5m x 3.7m\n\n\nKitchen/dining room - 5.8m x 5.5m\n\n\nUtility Room - 1.7m x 1.6m\n\n\nWC - 1.6m x 1.4m\n\n\nLanding - 3.0m x 1.5m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.5m x 4.3m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.1m x 1.9m\n\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 2.4m x 1.7m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.1m x 2.8m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.4m x 2.9m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.0m x 1.9m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Nestled in the heart of a picturesque town of Virginia in South Cavan and close to the Cavan/Meath border. this charming semi-detached house offers a spacious living environment.</li><li> With a total of 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and 1 reception room, this modern property spans across 116 square meters, providing ample space for comfortable living.</li><li> The house boasts a well-maintained interior, exuding a sense of peace and tranquillity throughout.</li><li> The property features a lovely south/west facing garden, perfect for outdoor relaxation and entertaining</li><li> Off-street parking for added convenience.</li><li> Its prime location in a quiet the popular development of the Drumlins that offers easy access to local amenities, schools, and transport links.</li><li> These features combined make it an ideal home for families or professionals looking for a peaceful retreat within reach of urban conveniences.</li><li> Natural Gas Central heating</li><li> Mains water and sewerage</li><li> Year of Construction : 2005</li><li> Alarm system installed</li><li> Don't miss the opportunity to make this beautiful house your new home. Contact us today to arrange a viewing.</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B\nBER No: 119728764\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Damian Keogan"
      }
